rning policy). Six globals: `entity` (create, destroy, alive, has/add/remove by component name), `transform` (get/set position, rotation w,x,y,z normalised, scale; all-or-nothing), `input` (value, down, pressed, released by action name), `assets` (find by path, exists, path, importer, dependencies by GUID text), `physics` (raycast, overlap_sphere, with an optional filter table), and `events` (on, off, emit; a failing handler is reported and the others still run). The host API is `ScriptEngine` (run, bind, set_global_entity, take_errors, stack_depth). The state opens only base, coroutine, table, string, math, utf8; `dofile` and `loadfile` are removed.
